    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47958" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέαινᾰ</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεά</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>goddess</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> mostly in phrase 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντες τε θεοὶ πᾶσαί τε θέαιναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.341
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν τε καὶ θεαινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					81.3
				</span></i>
			: in later 
				Ep.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				29
			</span></i>.</div>
